  m_Name: EN_GSulli_02
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteData
  NoteName: G. Sulli. 02
  NoteText: "03 - XX -197X\n\n-Viiktor says the lab is digging deeper, that they
    will soon find XXXXX. I don't believe it's \r\ntrue, so many stories and fantasies
    can't be true, can they? \n\r\n-I hope they do it soon, I can't sleep at night
    with those noises. Every night I hear \r\nvibrations through the structure. I
    thought it was the wind, but the wind isn't... rhythmic"
